No COUI source code is copied into this repository. What was reused is the design token table
(color values, type sizes, radii and component dimensions) and the publicly documented re-theme
specification. The C# implementation, control architecture, painting pipeline and demo are
original work.

Bundled typefaces
-----------------
The release package carries two fonts, both under the SIL Open Font License 1.1:

    LXGW WenKai (霞鹜文楷)      https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai
    LXGW ZhenKai GB (霞鹜臻楷)  https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwZhenKai

They are redistributed unmodified, as the OFL permits, and are loaded at runtime with
AddFontResourceEx in FR_PRIVATE mode (they are not installed system-wide). The fonts themselves
are not committed to this repository.

